1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,980
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,300
=Episode 5=

4
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:53,900
Your Majesty.

5
00:00:55,050 --> 00:00:56,940
I must still pay my respects
to the late Empress.

6
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,580
I'll take my leave.

7
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:08,770
Both are daughters of the Zhang family.

8
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:10,389
I thought by now

9
00:01:10,431 --> 00:01:13,290
she'd learned some of Roujia's kindness
and good sense.

10
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:17,570
Instead, she's grown even more vicious.

11
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:19,620
Summon her!

12
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:20,850
Yes.

13
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:23,660
Your Majesty.

14
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:25,380
A victory report has arrived.

15
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:26,820
General Zhang

16
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:28,439
triumphed in the northern frontier

17
00:01:28,481 --> 00:01:29,660
and captured three cities.

18
00:01:30,410 --> 00:01:32,260
In his report, he says

19
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:34,930
his troops fought and bled,

20
00:01:35,330 --> 00:01:37,020
and asks Your Majesty to reward them:

21
00:01:37,410 --> 00:01:38,690
a thousand taels of gold

22
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:40,290
and a hundred qing of fertile land

23
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:41,930
to boost morale.

24
00:01:46,850 --> 00:01:48,980
Consort Chen has quite the uncle.

25
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:51,570
Not only can he win battles,

26
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:53,210
he even

27
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:55,330
decides what rewards and favors

28
00:01:55,850 --> 00:01:57,100
I should bestow.

29
00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,690
Next time,

30
00:02:01,050 --> 00:02:03,599
he'll be asking for my imperial seal.

31
00:02:03,641 --> 00:02:04,100
Your Majesty!

32
00:02:10,930 --> 00:02:12,410
I'm only joking.

33
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:15,220
I still need his troops

34
00:02:16,130 --> 00:02:17,660
to hold the northern frontier.

35
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:20,639
Make sure the maid's family

36
00:02:20,681 --> 00:02:21,850
is properly compensated.

37
00:02:22,450 --> 00:02:24,319
Pick out a few suitable gifts

38
00:02:24,361 --> 00:02:25,660
and send them to Concubine Yu.

39
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:29,610
She served the late Empress, after all.

40
00:02:30,410 --> 00:02:31,730
Don't let her feel slighted.

41
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:33,060
Yes.

42
00:02:39,850 --> 00:02:40,500
Father.

43
00:02:43,410 --> 00:02:43,850
Come here.

44
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,410
What's that in your hand?

45
00:02:48,010 --> 00:02:49,389
The lady at the herbal medicine stall

46
00:02:49,431 --> 00:02:51,130
outside the cottage gave it to me.

47
00:02:52,290 --> 00:02:54,149
It smells just like the calming incense

48
00:02:54,191 --> 00:02:56,170
Mother burned when I was little.

49
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:10,730
It has a faint herbal scent.

50
00:03:12,450 --> 00:03:13,730
It's quite soothing.

51
00:03:17,570 --> 00:03:18,170
Li Dehai.

52
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:19,660
Yes?

53
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:21,260
Come for a walk with me.

54
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:22,010
Yes.

55
00:03:22,340 --> 00:03:22,850
Your Majesty.

56
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:30,060
(Medicine)

57
00:03:37,730 --> 00:03:38,940
Looks like I'm too late.

58
00:03:55,690 --> 00:03:56,340
Your Majesty.

59
00:03:57,010 --> 00:03:57,730
Shall I

60
00:03:57,980 --> 00:03:59,500
send someone to find her?

61
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:04,450
Never mind.

62
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:08,799
You lured him here.

63
00:04:08,841 --> 00:04:10,010
Why leave now?

64
00:04:10,660 --> 00:04:12,100
If he gets what he wants too easily,

65
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:13,570
he won't appreciate it.

66
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:15,290
But if you won't even see him,

67
00:04:15,730 --> 00:04:16,989
what if he leaves

68
00:04:17,031 --> 00:04:18,220
and never comes back?

69
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:20,500
This scent

70
00:04:21,410 --> 00:04:23,490
came from the woman Xiao Che loves.

71
00:04:24,220 --> 00:04:24,900
Once he smells it,

72
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:26,410
he won't forget it.

73
00:04:26,810 --> 00:04:27,490
If he can't forget it,

74
00:04:28,170 --> 00:04:29,370
he'll come back.

75
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:13,980
Your Majesty.

76
00:05:14,930 --> 00:05:15,930
You look

77
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:17,580
much better today

78
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:19,930
than you have lately.

79
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:25,220
I did sleep

80
00:05:25,780 --> 00:05:26,730
quite well last night.

81
00:05:34,890 --> 00:05:35,520
Oh!

82
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:37,810
The stall owner

83
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:39,900
is burning herbs this early.

84
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:46,580
I'm going out for a walk.

85
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:48,050
Yes, Your Majesty.

86
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:43,630
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

87
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,830
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

88
00:06:48,770 --> 00:06:51,070
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

89
00:06:51,390 --> 00:06:53,140
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

90
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:57,040
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

91
00:06:57,870 --> 00:07:01,030
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

92
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:05,390
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

93
00:07:06,310 --> 00:07:08,649
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

94
00:07:08,691 --> 00:07:10,820
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

95
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,070
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

96
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:18,220
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

97
00:07:19,810 --> 00:07:23,270
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

98
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:26,100
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

99
00:07:26,850 --> 00:07:30,450
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

100
00:07:31,910 --> 00:07:35,049
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

101
00:07:35,091 --> 00:07:40,270
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

102
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:48,600
♪The past has faded away♪

103
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:52,600
♪The past has faded away♪
